    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>African Rhapsody is a deeply grounding, heritage-rich bar that pairs an authentic, raw African Black Soap base with the sacred, woodsy aroma of Frankincense and the bracing clarity of Eucalyptus. It bridges the gap between deep skin detoxification and a meditative, high-end spa aromatherapy experience.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Deep Pore Clarification: The ash-based African Black Soap base naturally clears blockages and smooths problematic skin texture</li>
                    <li>Cellular Longevity: Frankincense acts as a powerful natural astringent, helping to protect skin cells and minimize the appearance of large pores</li>
                    <li>Respiratory &amp; Skin Refresh: Plant-derived Eucalyptus stimulates local circulation while its therapeutic vapors clear the senses during use</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Ideal For:</strong> Blemish-prone, oily, or congested skin.</p>
